  },
  "**[Bash] Yes! It's the Shadowkeeper! Formidable lupine abomination! We must kill him before he kills us!**": {
    "translation": "是魔狼暗影守卫!先手消灭它!"
  },
  "**[Bash] Prepare for battle! Do not get close or you will die immediately!**": {
    "translation": "准备战斗!靠近会被秒杀!"
  },
  "**[Balthier] Keep your shit and shoot this beast!**": {
    "translation": "稳住阵脚,集火这头野兽!"
  },
  "**[Bash] It's true form of Shadowkeeper! Oh no we doomed!**": {
    "translation": "暗影守卫真身!情况不妙!"
  },
  "**[Fran] Dont enter the teleporter! It's unstable and could send you anywhere**": {
    "translation": "传送还不稳定,先别进!"
  },
  "**[Fran] I think I managed to stabilize it! Get to the teleport!**": {
    "translation": "传送已稳定!快进传送点!"
  },
  "**[Vaan] Wait!? We have nowhere to run?**": {
    "translation": "等等!?已经无路可逃了吗?"
  },
  "**[Fran] Ill try to fix it but I dont know how long it?ll take**": {
    "translation": "我来抢修传送,尽量拖住!"
  },
  "**[Vaan] What's that!? Cactus...**": {
    "translation": "那是什么?!仙人掌.."
  },
  "**[Ashe] Not again... Shoot him because he will never leave us alone!**": {
    "translation": "又是它,快开枪打掉仙人掌!"
  },
  "**Judge Bergan has casted Aura of Water!**": {
    "translation": "[贝甘]<水华> 按W抵抗!"
  },
  "**Judge Bergan has casted 1000 Needles!**": {
    "translation": "[贝甘]<千根针> 蹲下!"
  },
  "**Judge Bergan is going to throw his blade! Do not stay together!**": {
    "translation": "[贝甘]掷剑攻击,分散站位!"
  },
  "**Judge Bergan has cased Flash of Burning Souls!**": {
    "translation": "[贝甘]<燃烧之魂> 远离中场火!"
  },
  "**Judge Bergan has casted Dedication Aura!**": {
    "translation": "[贝甘]<献祭之光> 停火!"
