  "**Judge Bergan has casted Rage of Magic!**": {
    "translation": "[贝甘]<魔力爆散> 下招秒杀中场!"
  },
  "**Judge Bergan has casted Flash of Shattering!**": {
    "translation": "[贝甘]<闪耀破碎>"
