  "**Judge Bergan has casted Frost Fury!**": {
    "translation": "[贝甘]<霜寒爆裂>"
  },
  "**Judge Bergan has casted Soul Siphon!**": {
    "translation": "[贝甘]<灵魂虹吸> 远离头顶火球"
